## Query 7: Exceptions

A filtered view of Fact_Table showing only rows that need attention. Load this to a worksheet (not just the data model) so you can review it directly on the Exceptions tab.

```m
let
    Source = Fact_Table,

    OnlyExceptions = Table.SelectRows(Source, each [Match_Flag] <> "OK"),

    Reordered = Table.SelectColumns(OnlyExceptions, {
        "Period",
        "Project_ID",
        "Currency",
        "Hours",
        "Estimated_Total",
        "Match_Flag"
    }),

    SortByFlag = Table.Sort(Reordered, {{"Match_Flag", Order.Ascending}, {"Period", Order.Descending}})
in
    SortByFlag
```

For this query only, **Close & Load To → Table → Existing Worksheet** and point at the Exceptions tab below the summary section.

