## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `Match_Flag = UNMATCHED PROJECT` for many rows | New projects not in Project Master | Add them; rerun |
| `Match_Flag = MISSING FX` | New currency or new period | Add row to FX Rates tab |
| Budget variance is huge / nonsensical | `Region_Product_Period` mismatch | Check that bridge keys are identical (case, spacing, separators) |
| Refresh extremely slow | Folder has too many historical files | Archive files > 24 months to a subfolder excluded by the filter |
| Privacy levels error on first load | Mix of SharePoint + local data | File → Options → Privacy → Ignore Privacy Levels (acceptable for trusted firm sources) |
